SX127x: wire the instantaneous RSSI callback into the loramac-node Radio table.

sx12xx_lora_rssi() calls Radio.Rssi(), but sx127x.c leaves that callback NULL.
The observer crash at PC=0 resolves through sx127x_get_rssi_inst(),
hwGetRssiBurst(), triggerNoiseFloorCalibrate() and maintenanceLoop().
Map the existing SX1272ReadRssi/SX1276ReadRssi library functions for each
supported devicetree variant and populate Rssi. No radio-state changes.

This patch is the sole owner of drivers/lora/loramac-node/sx127x.c.
Full macro/table context supports host regression tests without a west checkout.

